Assignment: Product Management API 

Create a simple Product Management System using HTML and JavaScript.

Use the Fake Store API:
https://fakestoreapi.com/products

Requirements
Create an HTML page with 5 buttons:
View Products
Add Product
Update Product
Update Product Price
Delete Product

Create the following JavaScript functions:
getProducts() → Use GET to fetch all products and display them in the console.
addProduct() → Use POST to add a new product with:
Title
Price
Category
updateProduct() → Use PUT to completely update product with ID 1.
updatePrice() → Use PATCH to update only the price of product ID 1.
deleteProduct() → Use DELETE to delete product ID 1.
Use async/await for all API requests.

Convert API responses using:
await response.json()
Display the response of every operation using console.log().
Product Example

For POST, you can send:

const product = {
    title: "Wireless Headphones",
    price: 1999,
    category: "electronics"
};
